":0,"created_at":"2026-10-11T18:38:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:47:13Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124383","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124383","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124383.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124383.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\n- Address part of #116108\n\n## Additional information\n\nCurrently some buttons are only accessible with keyboard navigation if accessibility is turned on. This isn't ideal as the amount of things that you can move to with this mode turned on is huge and many don't matter if you just want to move with keyboard.\n\nThis PR removes `FOCUS_ACCESSIBILITY`, basically all of these previously were `FOCUS_NONE`, from various button in the editor UI, specifically ones where the only thing needed to do is remove the `set_focus_mode` override and were easy to \"test\" to see if any change is also needed to do.\n\nSome examples of buttons that weren't changed were:\n\n- The hide buttons in editor and help as pressing those buttons makes nothing have focus.\n- The solo, mute, etc. buttons in AudioBus as you can't see when focus is on them\n- Some buttons in some docks/plugins as to get the buttons to appear required specific things on scene or more setup so it was harder to test if nothing went wrong.\n- Prev/next buttons weren't touched as their behaviour is not really standard along the editor, if they can be focused when disables, for example in the Asset Store they can't but in the inspector they can.\n\nMost of these focus overrides were added when the code was initially added, I tested them to see if they work and all of them seemed normal but if for any reason they shouldn't be removed please tell me.\n\nNo AI used.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124383/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124383/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}